OL,3,GNEWSALion dies after eye procedure
OL,4,Arevealed illness
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Asiatic lion has died after kidney
OL,7,Ffailure was discovered during a recent
OL,8,Feye procedure.
OL,10,FSpecialist veterinary ophthalmologist
OL,11,FDr David Williams, from the University
OL,12,Fof Cambridge, operated on 10-year-old
OL,13,FSahee's eyelid in August.
OL,15,FAt the same time, Hertfordshire Zoo
OL,16,Fcarried out a full health assessment
OL,17,Fwhich revealed advanced, irreversible
OL,18,Fkidney failure and Sahee's condition
OL,19,Fdeteriorated quickly.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
