OL,3,GNEWSALion dies after eye procedure
OL,4,Arevealed illness
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter his death was confirmed on
OL,7,FWednesday, the zoo said: "To prevent
OL,8,Ffurther suffering and ensure his
OL,9,Fwelfare remained paramount, the
OL,10,Fdifficult decision was made to put him
OL,11,Fto sleep."
